cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software as follows."
title: "BIOSZEN"
type: software
abstract: "BIOSZEN provides reproducible biological data analysis and visualization from Excel files, including configurable plots, statistical workflows, growth-curve parameter extraction from fixed or irregular time points, and concentration-response curves with IC50 estimation and strain comparisons."
